      "intent_anchors": [
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA1",
          "statement": "Preserve the pebble silhouette with a minimum corner radius of 14 mm and continuous convex surfaces; no flat side walls or sharp transitions that break the soft hand feel.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA2",
          "statement": "Maintain the 25 mm overall height as the maximum; local sealing bosses may protrude internally only and must not exceed 26 mm external envelope.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA3",
          "statement": "IP67 sealing must be achieved via a single compression gasket in a recessed channel and an ePTFE membrane vent behind the front intake field; the vent must not be obstructed by the display or USB cutouts.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA4",
          "statement": "Housing material must be 100% post-consumer recycled ABS (rABS) with a soft-touch matte coating; no virgin plastic or gloss finish.",
          "category": "sustainability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA5",
          "statement": "Keep the display window centred horizontally at 36% from the top and the intake field at 78% from the top to preserve the calm, instrument-like front face composition.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA6",
          "statement": "Housing BOM must stay within the relaxed ceiling of CNY 16 per unit by using a two-cavity family mould for top and bottom shells and avoiding secondary painting beyond the soft-touch coat.",
          "category": "cost",
          "must_preserve": true
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "This concept adapts the DFM-safe rounded-rectangle reference into a premium soft pebble direction while respecting the relaxed B5 contract. The 122 x 72 x 25 mm envelope sits inside the allowed 125 x 75 x 26 mm, and the 25 mm height is the minimum needed for the PCB and battery stack with 1.5 mm walls. The 14 mm corner radius and continuous convex surfaces deliver the soft, premium hand feel associated with the 'soft_pebble' direction. The front face is deliberately sparse: a 48 x 22 mm display window at 36% height for glanceable readings, and a 15% open-area intake field at 78% height feeding an internal ePTFE membrane vent. The USB-C port is centred on the bottom face, protected by a moulded lip and a captive gasket flap, keeping the front face clean. Material is 100% post-consumer rABS with a soft-touch matte coating in matte basalt grey, meeting the sustainability and premium finish requirements. The housing cost is held within the relaxed CNY 16 ceiling by using a two-cavity family mould, avoiding complex slides, and limiting secondary operations to soft-touch coating and pad-printed branding. Mass is estimated at 118 g, inside the relaxed 151 g limit. The design resolves the core conflicts by accepting the relaxed height, mass, and cost values, and by using a gasket plus ePTFE vent to reconcile IP67 with the required open intake area."
    },
